    "title": "Half Moon Bay Recreation Department Offering Free, 10-Week, Co-Ed Beach Volleyball League at Poplar Beach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By mdrag ,\n1 days ago Getting your Trinity Audio player ready... PRESS RELEASE. From the City of Half Moon Bay – Recreation & Community Services Facebook page on March 20th, 2026. The City of Half Moon Bay Recreation Department is offering a free, co-ed beach volleyball league this summer. The casual, 10-week league welcomes all ages and allows teams of two or four players to compete against other coastside teams. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
